failure.message:
AssertionError: 'Alice@Example.com' registered as a second account although 'alice@example.com' already exists (emails must be unique case-insensitively); got 201 {"user_id":3}
assert 201 == 409
 +  where 201 = <Response [201 Created]>.status_code

AssertionError: login with a different letter case of a registered email was rejected; got 401 {"detail":"Invalid email or password"}
assert 401 == 200
 +  where 401 = <Response [401 Unauthorized]>.status_code
